{"decisions":[{"i":0,"decision":"U","origin":null,"reason":"The excerpt calls these the first three standards, but the supplied evidence only establishes that the Secretary approved three standards; it neither confirms nor contradicts their priority.","sourceEvidence":"The source evidence says the Secretary of Commerce approved three standards, FIPS 203, 204 and 205, in August 2024; it does not call them the first three.","synthesisStatement":"The synthesis identifies FIPS 203, 204 and 205 and their purposes, but does not establish that they were the first standards.","narrativeStatement":"The selected story title calls them the first three; the story progression provides no supporting evidence for that priority claim.","materiality":"The priority claim may matter to how readers understand the standards’ place in NIST’s work, but the evidence is insufficient to assess its accuracy."}]}

